-- 𝑻𝒓𝒂𝒗𝒆𝒍 widens to everything that makes a place worth wandering through: its sights, its food,
-- markets and customs, and portraits taken there or of its people, wherever they were shot. The
-- description and the brief change only where an admin has not edited them since 0011.
-- A moment keeps the likes its post had when X confirmed it, which picks the map's favorites.
ALTER TABLE travel_moments ADD COLUMN likes BIGINT CHECK (likes >= 0);

UPDATE topics SET description = '世界各地在 X 上分享的风景、风土人情与人物，以及目的地的历史文化导读', updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'travel' AND description = '世界各地在 X 上分享的风景、人文与当地生活中的人，以及目的地的历史文化导读';

UPDATE topics SET brief = $new$中文：从 X 上挑选与世界各地有关的照片分享和发帖人自己的文字，覆盖风景（自然风光、城市街巷、建筑古迹、四季景色）、风土人情（美食与特产、市集与老店、节庆与民俗、手艺与街头生活）和人物（美丽优雅的女性写真，当地服饰、时装、街拍、摄影会与影棚写真都可以，以及旅行者与当地人的生活照），兼顾各大洲，让浏览像在各地闲逛，沉浸式感受各地的风土人情。发帖人可以是旅行者、摄影师、模特、当地居民、店铺、官方账号或分享照片的账号。照片清晰好看、让人想去。排除明显的促销广告、AI 生成图、以儿童为主体的照片、偷拍或泄露的私密照片，以及正文没有写明地点的帖子。
English: Pick photograph posts about places across the world on X, with the poster's own words, covering landscapes (nature, streets, architecture and heritage, the seasons), local ways (food and specialties, markets and old shops, festivals and folk customs, crafts and street life) and people (beautiful, elegant portraits of women in local dress or fashion, from street shoots, photo meetups or studios, and travelers' and locals' everyday photographs) on every continent, so browsing feels like wandering through each place and its ways. Posters may be travelers, photographers, models, locals, shops, official accounts or accounts that share photographs. Photographs are clear, beautiful and make people want to go. Exclude obvious promotional ads, AI-generated images, photographs centered on children, voyeuristic or leaked private photos, and posts whose text does not name the place.$new$, updated_at = NOW()
WHERE id = 'travel' AND brief = $old$中文：从 X 上挑选世界各地的旅途与生活分享：在当地拍摄的照片和发帖人自己的文字，覆盖风景（自然风光、城市街巷、建筑古迹）、人文（当地生活、美食市集、节庆与手艺）和人物（旅行者与当地人在当地的照片，自拍、合影、街头和日常生活中的人都可以），兼顾各大洲；多收有人的照片，让人感到逛当地生活的气息。发帖人可以是旅行者、摄影爱好者或当地居民。照片清晰好看、让人想去。排除转发他人照片的聚合账号、广告、AI 生成图、以儿童为主体的照片、偷拍或泄露的私密照片，以及正文没有写明地点的帖子。
English: Pick travel and everyday posts from across the world on X: photographs taken on the spot with the poster's own words, covering landscapes (nature, streets, architecture and heritage), local life (food and markets, festivals and crafts) and people (travelers and locals photographed there, selfies, groups, people in the streets and in daily life) on every continent. Favor photographs with people in them, so browsing feels like walking through local life. Posters may be travelers, photographers or locals. Photographs are clear, beautiful and make people want to go. Exclude aggregators reposting others' photographs, ads, AI-generated images, photographs centered on children, voyeuristic or leaked private photos, and posts whose text does not name the place.$old$;
